{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b935635b7bd6de739d78be38e4f27a7ee1936bc0fe26da78ae201d59c82d97a",
      "text": "新型空调广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f1afbbb3951aa1bdf26c9257bc6ed7b743453f3155fe2668a9d4c06d175863e",
      "text": "“嚯，这么大的房间，\n居然一眨眼的工夫就能调到舒适的温度啊”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76e2aeb6c6d85d0ec8190357680532e54a3b22b5e07ab73b431d0da17493e70d",
      "text": "“不论炎炎夏日还是刺骨寒冬，都帮了大忙呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:782c1a46e650a93c4b67ea0dcad9401a7fc2620c2df0a3e46f480fbe06bb0fef",
      "text": "“来，干脆就这么稍微睡个午觉吧。\n你也一起来如何？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000045:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b778da12e44b043eb3a21bef897722f6e5014accfaf2495bacec6def645c7bcf",
      "text": "拍摄后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60e2742d4fd145e11a6704ce738e362b673219587a6670879df58fe9271444f3",
      "text": "辛苦了，雨彦先生。\n一次就过了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9754f2884e7b276d6c7384c2e8e38a0b1437023ee7b047a0f84ffbd680cd275",
      "text": "导演也说拍到了很好的画面，\n真期待广告播出的那一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:757666cd10c6b2fedd61174f8397122d8c962ae739a2ed7d87b48422b06d5557",
      "text": "嗯，拍摄顺利真是太好了。\n话说回来，那台空调的性能相当优秀啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80a3edb9588e627adab1215f4d618146d3f9e3a2a626a1643cbb5696b1feea26",
      "text": "确实正如“一机在手，全年舒适生活”这条\n宣传标语所说的一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbe867d8d3191027cdb9b6e0e708d9fd6933ca880d1a3a37c71d9b2f277ef711",
      "text": "呵呵，您这么中意它啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b9176a2d01ddeee6538ec00a25f7ff23cd52f18631613448d8746700a7a8cfe",
      "text": "因为我受不了夏天的炎热啊。\n这种东西难免会在意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_04:1_5_044_04:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3472b174b7b17599b449e083dafd80da388db693cdada52da0fd4098110e7ed",
      "text": "为了能安然度过酷暑，\n真希望空调也能不断进化下去啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
